	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 61d — review -->\n\nOpenXR & Godot XR — Skill Tree Path\n\n\"Read the docs, check off the nodes.\"\n\nA documentation-driven learning path for OpenXR and Godot XR development. Each node links to a specific piece of official documentation — read it, understand it, mark the checkpoint complete. The tree enforces prerequisite order so you build knowledge bottom-up.\n\nSkill Tree Structure\n\nSeeded in the skill-trees database (tree_id: openxr_godot). 30…",
